Package: FIMSdiags
Title: Diagnostics for FIMS Models
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Megumi", "Oshima", , "megumi.oshima@noaa.gov", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ian", "Taylor", , "ian.taylor@noaa.gov", role = "aut")
  )
Description: FIMSdiags is a companion package to FIMS. It allows users to run common diagnostic analyses on their FIMS models. FIMSdiags is in active development and we are continuously adding features and improving current ones.
